Raise the multi-MCU homing sync timeout from 25 ms to 50 ms, as Flashforge's
Klipper does. Apply only if X homing (endstop on the eboard, steppers on the
mainboard) fails with "Communication timeout during homing".

  git -C <klipper> apply klipper/patches/trsync-timeout-50ms.patch

--- a/klippy/mcu.py
+++ b/klippy/mcu.py
@@ -281,7 +281,7 @@
             s.note_homing_end()
         return params['trigger_reason']
 
-TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = 0.025
+TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = 0.050
 TRSYNC_SINGLE_MCU_TIMEOUT = 0.250
 
 class TriggerDispatch:
